message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FDA-Cleared Rapid Resistance Test Landscape: a device-by-target dataset of rapid blood culture identification/resistance panels and rapid phenotypic susceptibility systems"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
authors:
  - family-names: Abdulwahab
    given-names: Fatima
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Dallas, Texas, USA"
