repository-code: "https://github.com/FatimaAbdulwahab/fda-rapid-resistance-test-landscape"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - bloodstream infection
  - blood culture identification
  - rapid antimicrobial susceptibility testing
  - FDA 510(k)
  - De Novo
  - clinical microbiology
  - in vitro diagnostics
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of FDA-cleared and De Novo-authorized rapid molecular blood culture identification and
  resistance panels and rapid phenotypic susceptibility systems for positive blood cultures. For each device
  family it records organism and resistance targets, antimicrobial-organism indications, specimen type, and
  labeled limitations, including what a negative result does and does not rule out, each traced to a 510(k)
  or De Novo number, decision date and page of the FDA source document.
